{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Don\u2019t Wake Up My Dream</strong> is a lighthearted puzzle-adventure game about a dreamy dog on a surreal and emotional journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dog boards a train going who-knows-where.<br>Is it a long journey through distant places, or a dream that never ends?<br>Deep in his heart, a quiet wish is waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into his dreams\u2014each chapter a standalone story filled with imagination, surprises, and playful puzzles. From sweet romantic detours to absurd daily mishaps, you\u2019ll uncover curious moments that shape how the story unfolds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exploration-Driven Story</strong><br>Discover strange and delightful events simply by exploring. Every choice and hidden moment adds a layer to the story\u2014and may change how the dream ends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unexpected Events &amp; Multiple Endings</strong><br>Your actions influence different outcomes, with endings that range from heartwarming to hilariously unexpected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relaxing, Varied Gameplay</strong><br>A mix of gentle puzzles, quirky interactions, light mini-games, and casual problem-solving\u2014designed to be fun, funny, and chill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hand-Drawn Art &amp; Original Music</strong><br>Featuring cozy hand-drawn visuals and a heartfelt soundtrack that bring warmth and humor to the dream world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736300/extras/0606__3__1_.2025-06-17_18_13_17.gif?t=1750247788\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap