ents simply by exploring. Every choice and hidden moment adds a layer to the story\u2014and may change how the dream ends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unexpected Events &amp; Multiple Endings</strong><br>Your actions influence different outcomes, with endings that range from heartwarming to hilariously unexpected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relaxing, Varied Gameplay</strong><br>A mix of gentle puzzles, quirky interactions, light mini-games, and casual problem-solving\u2014designed to be fun, funny, and chill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hand-Drawn Art &amp; Original Music</strong><br>Featuring cozy hand-drawn visuals and a heartfelt soundtrack that bring warmth and humor to the dream world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736300/extras/0606__3__1_.2025-06-17_18_13_17.gif?t=1750247788\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736300/extras/0606__3__15_.2025-06-17_18_11_07.gif?t=1750247788\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736300/extras/0606__3__10_.2025-06-17_18_04_38.gif?t=1750247788\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736300/extras/0606__3__9_.2025-06-17_18_09_07.gif?t=1750247788\" /></div></p>","developers":["Naivus Luo"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736300/f30cd6b8cf1b288e5dcf060f573458f6c2c8e872/header.jpg?t=1750247788","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirement